{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"d754ceb8301146388daba266a1757fdb9ca1b153f0ee327866e97809db77743b","ja":"最終審査に向けて……","zh":"迈向最终审查……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"810c374884b1e225d59f472d4d2a0155ff1f816e786b0b69f730b2bf2f26ce0e","ja":"「私だって……ずっとあなたが好きだった。\nもう、なんで気づかないの？　バカッ！」","zh":"“我也……一直都很喜欢你啊。\n真是的，你怎么就没察觉到呢？笨蛋！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"46d6135a5c69cfd05cb074f9a3cc38faf5f0fb590997d4212f48cd3855d22662","ja":"うーん、もうちょっとかわいく言った方が\nいいのかな？　この子の性格を考えると……ぶつぶつ。","zh":"嗯——是不是说得再可爱一点比较好呢？\n考虑到这孩子的性格的话……嘟囔嘟囔。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"43daf2471a6b350f4327c20c7f7a2c172984efdef2d76786c1d916211e1a2cf7","ja":"（奈緒も最終審査に残ったみたいだし……。\n自分も、もっと頑張らなきゃ！）","zh":"（奈绪好像也进入了最终审查……\n我也得更加努力才行！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"95a11ae9783a77110c6b873928f20efc67f30fe2f528b06524fcbf9111102619","ja":"「大丈夫、ちゃんとわかってるから……。\nあはは、どれだけ見守ってきたと思ってるの？」","zh":"「没事的，我都明白的……。\n啊哈哈，你以为我都注视你多久啦？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2ac0d6719f39dbd1465f2616c73fe68cc6bc862b9c1c482b4fd647be2851b07c","ja":"……アカン！　もっと一途な感じを丁寧に表現して、\nみんなの心をわしづかみにせんと！","zh":"……不行！必须把更专一的感觉细致地表现出来，\n牢牢抓住大家的心才行！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cf4becb1d8bfdb0fcb14d5451f8623a3144cfee6e32b34f8b3af55e436eaedfc","ja":"（響のことや、忙しくても何回も\n台本読み込んでるはず……。私も負けられへんで！）","zh":"（以响的性格，就算再忙，也肯定把台本\n翻来覆去看过很多遍了……我也不能输啊！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c3fc882b377ad61853d2dc545a1eeb8fb0d8f25e7bc9744033e0600e8b022e75","ja":"そして、最終審査まであと数日となったある日……","zh":"然后，在距离最终审查只剩几天的某一天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"c91a3c3b7f0415137bc6fe1221400e082d3bac53899c18111767eace6f457854","ja":"……えっ、新しい台本！？\n変更があったの？　●●●●プロデューサー。","zh":"……诶，新的剧本！？\n有改动吗？●●●●制作人。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1255.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5a05b27eca343d389e2cf45125f22db9d4fb89b4aca360c04c761ccce3a2e89c","ja":"いったいどこが変わったの？\n……って……。","zh":"到底哪里变了啊？\n……呃……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
